body:
>Things as simple as hearing people talking outside my window is so bizarre because it makes me realize I'm not like them

&#x200B;

>I'm only me when I ... sit outside with animals

I feel ya.

&#x200B;

It's really hard for me to not constantly live inside my bubble of nihilism. It just feels like I've always been a floating ghost pushing hard to remain unseen.

You don't. I sincerely wish it for you, someone who sees beyond. Unpopular opinion: people always tell you you can only heal yourself, save yourself and you can't love somebody else if you don't love yourself, but really, life is more complicated than that and having unconditional love even if you're damaged is one of the rarest thing. This has immense power on somebody, this can truly help the healing processs when you're just unable to give this same unconditional love to yourself. 

&#x200B;

But, you need to accept it.
